The '''Gaulus sector''' was a [[sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]] region of [[the galaxy]]. It contained the [[Ryloth system]],<ref name="USW" /> the location of the [[planet]] [[Ryloth]], which was the site of a [[Battle of Ryloth|battle]] during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="SOR" />

Following the [[Proclamation of the New Order|rise]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], a faction of the [[Twi'lek]] [[species]] native to Ryloth rebelled against the Empire in the [[Ryloth Insurgency]], which led to the [[Sith Lord]]s [[Darth Sidious]] and [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] [[Mission to Ryloth|visiting the world]].<ref name="LOTS" />

